  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Subsidy for the Loan Portfolio Guarantee to       Barclays with USAID - Subsidy for the Loan Guarantee with Barclays/Std</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Subvention f&#xf6;r portf&#xf6;ljgaranti till Barclays      med USAID</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bidrag till kostnaderna f&#xf6;r l&#xe5;negaranti till Barclays i samarbete med USAID f&#xf6;r att stimulera utl&#xe5;ning till sm&#xe5;f&#xf6;retag med fokus p&#xe5;         kvinnor, ungdomar (18-35 &#xe5;r)och jordbrukssektorn.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Subsidy to the cost of Loan Guarantee to Barclays in partnership with USAID to stimulate lending to micro, small and medium enterprises     (MSMEs) owned by majority youth and women and MSMEs employing         majority youth and MSMEs in the Agricultural sector.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the loan guarantee is to improve financial inclusion, promote a more efficient financial sector and stimulate economic growth in Zimbabwe.

The purpose of the guarantee is to increase Iending to the underserved sector borrowers, allowing them to expand in terms of profits and job-creation. The loan scheme aims at promoting economic empowerment through access to finance.</narrative>
  </description>
